    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t Kuɔth Nhial ti ba gɔ̱a̱r pa̱a̱m kä Päm Ee-bal",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ bööth I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ naath wäkä i̱, “Tiɛtdɛ luëëk diaal tin cä la̱t yɛ ɛn walɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mäni cäŋ in wiaa jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn muun in ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ ka̱m yɛ, muɔcɛ rɔ kɛ pääm ti di̱t, kä rɔathɛ jɔkdiɛn kɛ liɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gɔ̱a̱rɛ rieet ŋuɔ̱tni diaal thi̱n, mi wiaa wä kui̱c muun in ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ɛ ka̱m yɛ, mun caak kɛnɛ liɛɛth tuar, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial Kuoth gua̱nikun ɛ guɔ̱k yɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä yɛn jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn, bia pääm tëë cä la̱r yɛ ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ ka̱n Pääm Ee-bal, kä bia kɛ rɔth kɛ liɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wi̱ni bia Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun ta̱th yi̱k päämni. Kä /cuarɛ wi̱cdiɛn moc riäk yieethä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi̱k päämni ti /ka̱n kuac biɛ ta̱th Kuoth Nhial Kuothdun, kä bi muc tin waŋkɛ thöp Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu wi̱i̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bia muc tɛthkä lɔaac thöp thi̱n, kä ba cam thi̱n. Kä bi /lɔcdu cu tɛɛth nhiam Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi rieet ŋuɔ̱tni diaal ɛ ti gɔ̱a̱r päämni tɔ̱tɔ̱ a jɔc.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ kɛnɛ bööth palä ni ji̱ Lii-bay ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jiök i̱, “Pa̱lɛ rɔ piny kä liɛŋɛ jɛ lö ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Ɛn ni̱ni ti̱ti̱ ci yɛn a nɛɛ Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ luɔ̱thɛ jɔw Kuɔth Nhial Kuothdun, kɛ luth ŋuɔ̱tnikɛ ti cä la̱t yɛ ti walɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kueth nɛɛni ti thil ŋa̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ bä cu Muthɛ naath jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mi wä yɛn jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn, thuk duëli ti̱ti̱ akɛ cuŋ pääm Gɛ-ri-dhim kɛ ɣöö ba nath poth, kɛn ji̱ Cim-on, ji̱ Lii-bay, ji̱ Juda, ji̱ Yi-tha-kar, ji̱ Jo-thɛp, ji̱ Ben-ya-min. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi nɛy ɛ ti cuɔ̱ŋ pääm Ee-bal kɛ kui̱ kueth nath, kɛn ji̱ Rɛ-u-ben, ji̱ Gad, ji̱ A-cɛr, kɛ ji̱ Dhɛ-bu-lun, ji̱ Daan, kɛ ji̱ Nap-ta-li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ji̱ Lii-bay ɛ la̱r ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
