          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Kueth akɛ ram in bi kuth baaŋ täth, tin lo̱k Kuoth Nhial kɛ, tin ta̱thkɛ kɛ tet beli.’ Kä bi nɛy diaal ɛ loc i̱, ‘Inɔnɔ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
